		        <button type="button" class="rc-btn rc-bulk-popular" title="Minimal + main towns + popular fields & dungeons + map textures. Drops WoE castles, PvP arenas, quest one-shot maps. ~3.2 GB.">+ Popular (~3.2 GB)</button>
